## Big Nate Chat Modes

### Marketing Mode (enhanced)

New action patterns: `post_analytics`, `engagement_summary`, `optimal_posting_time`, `top_engaged`, `platform_comparison`. All are read-only (no confirmation required).

### Campaign Manager Mode (new)

Triggered by: "campaign status", "campaign report", "episode performance", "pause campaign", "extend campaign".

Actions: `campaign_status`, `campaign_report`, `pause_campaign`, `extend_campaign`, `launch_campaign`.

